flowchart TD
    Req([Incoming request]) --> LB[Load balancer]
    LB --> Q{Which layer makes the routing decision?}
    Q -->|Layer 4: transport| L4["Inspect source IP and port only"]
    Q -->|Layer 7: application| L7["Inspect URL, headers, and cookies"]
    L4 --> L4R["Route by IP and port to a server pool: fast, low CPU"]
    L7 --> L7R["Route by content, for example /api to the API pool"]
    L4R --> Pool[(Backend servers)]
    L7R --> Pool
